<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fletcher Challenge results due Feb 26.</title>
<headline>Fletcher Challenge results due Feb 26.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fletcher Challenge Ltd on Wednesday said it would report the trading results of its Building, Energy, Forest and Paper divisions for the six months to December 31 at 9.00 a.m. on February 26.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
